  "description": "**Apex Protocol\nEfficiency** is our standard. We are a goal-oriented collective focused on maximizing progress through consistent, active play.\n-\n* Requirement: **Mandatory contribution to Guild Challenges.** \n * Items placed in the stockpile will count towards contributions. All items go towards building and maintaining the Guild Hall.  \n * Discord: **https://discord.gg/UnMzezMR5x** (Not Mandatory)\n\n* Have Fun ♥️\n\nCurrent Guild Hall Goal\n---\n\n* **Energizing Pool Repair ⚡**\n* Overall Progress: **92.0%**\n\n**Resources Collected:**\n\n* Spruce Log: 12,500 / 12,500 (100% ✅)\n* Maple Log: 12,500 / 12,500 (100% ✅)\n* Mystical Log: 4,329 / 7,500 (57.7%)\n* Iron Bar: 7,500 / 7,500 (100% ✅)\n* Mercury Bar: 6,279 / 7,500 (83.7%)\n* Uranium Bar: 7,500 / 7,500 (100% ✅)\n\n\nRaid Schedule \n---\n\n* Weekdays at 1:00 PM EDT \n* Location: Floating Garden\n\n\nGuild Achievements\n-\n * Guild Hall ✔️\n * Mission Table ✔️\n * Unity Seal ✔️\n * Raid Planner ✔️\n * Energizing Pool ✔️",
